# interplay_dag_fan_in_16: Sixteen children each run a source node, on its own chain, held on the gate: all sixteen block on the gate's stamp and the root blocks on its join, a node with sixteen barriers, one on each child (seventeen FIFOs waiting at once, under the waiter mask's 32, docs/testing.md 6.7). The gate's NOP releases the sixteen; the join reads every child's result. Phase 1 fans out from the root to the sixteen (each continuing its chain) and joins them again on the root, sixteen barriers on stamps not yet pushed when it is parsed.
